WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.057
For an applications-focused workflow, the important ideas are when to fine-tune, when not to, how low rah works,

00:00:07.057 --> 00:00:13.337
what the dataset looks like, and what the cost tradeoffs are.

00:00:13.337 --> 00:00:20.002
Large-scale distributed training and optimizer research belong to a deeper model-training workflow.

00:00:20.002 --> 00:00:26.642
The goal here is to understand the decision and the workflow well enough to use low rah responsibly,

00:00:26.642 --> 00:00:30.809
not to turn this module into a large-scale model-training course.
